  "contract": "Ascension (CoA changelog 2025-03-31): 'Caches/Spoils Armor Type acquisition based on proficiencies of classes improved.' #12200 reported a Mail-wearing Witch Hunter tank receiving Leather from Callboard Caches. AscensionCallboardCache::PickReward checked CanUseItem and spec primary stats without excluding lower body-armor classes; in cache 1615001, 65 of ~100 Agility-primary items wearable by a Mail class are Leather (plus 11 Cloth), so 10 opens without filtering yield lower armor >99.9% of the time. Expected: a level 60 Witch Hunter (class 15, Mail proficiency) in Witchknight spec (ChrSpecs 97, Agility/Stamina) opening ten Heroic Dungeon Callboard Caches (1615001) receives ten pool items and zero Cloth or Leather body armor (below_armor_class: 3).",
